<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GPG extends offer for Ballarat Brewing.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GPG extends offer for Ballarat Brewing.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinness Peat Group Plc said on Monday it had extended the takeover offer period for The Ballarat Brewing Co Ltd until October 8.</p>
<p>The bid was due to close on September 10.</p>
<p>GPG said in a statement it was currently entitled to 15.77 percent of Ballarat stock, up from 15.76 when it made the takeover bid on June 28.</p>
<p>GPG has offered A$2.45 a share for the brewing company.</p>
<p>Ballarat shares closed steady at A$2.48.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
